      "id": "r20261027-a01",
      "title": "Lina's Lemonade Stand",
      "level": "Dasar",
      "min": 2,
      "body": [
        "It is summer holiday, and Lina wants to earn some pocket money. She decides to sell lemonade in front of her house.",
        "On the first day, she makes twenty glasses of lemonade. Her little sister draws a colorful sign, and her mom helps her carry the table outside. Each glass costs five thousand rupiah.",
        "By five o'clock, Lina has sold all twenty glasses. She is tired but proud. She gives half of the money to her mom to keep safe, and tomorrow she will make thirty glasses."
      ],
      "gloss": {
        "earn": "mendapatkan",
        "pocket money": "uang saku",
